WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.102
-I saw you tweeted
that you would have a hard time

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
living in New York
because of the restaurants.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.739
-I would. I live in Houston.
There's traffic everywhere.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.140 size:84% position:42%
I mean, if I want to go
somewhere out to eat,

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's about 20 or 30 minutes
to get there.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.011 line:92%
Here, you walk downstairs,

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.546
and it's literally pizza, sushi,
ice cream, pizza, sushi.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.182
My girlfriend and I were walking
around and we were like,

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, we don't really have
anything going on.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.086 line:92%
Should we stop for some food?"

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we'll stop in,
and we'll get pizza,

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then we're walking
20 more feet, and she's like,

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I heard of this restaurant.
It's incredible.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We have to go in."

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm like,
"Well, we have to go in."

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
I swear to God
I'd be 450 pounds.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you ever end up
on the Giants or the Jets,

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
people should just know now
to be disappointed.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you should prob--
Just void my contract

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.976
or move me to the offensive line
right out of the gate.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.745
-You got -- You were at
the Super Bowl this year.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.548
Obviously, you guys,
the Texans, had a great season.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
It didn't end the way
you wanted it to.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
You went to
the Super Bowl because,

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.319 size:75% position:38%
as a previous winner
of Man of the Year,

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
you presented it
to this year's winner.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was there any joy
in being at the Super Bowl

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.626 size:88% position:44% line:92%
without your team there?

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Yeah. Huge bummer?

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Could you watch the game?

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Yeah, okay.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:12.205
-[ Laughs ] I handed out the
award right before the game.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.540 line:92%
They did the opening kickoff,

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was on a jet
30 minutes later.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
I couldn't do it.
I can't do it. It's tough.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:20.346
-Do you watch -- When the season
ends, do you watch at all?

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.749
-I mean, I'll watch -- Obviously
I check out the highlights.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.718
I want to see what happened
in the game and everything.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:26.886 size:75% position:38% line:92%
But it's tough, man.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, you work so hard,
and you put in so much work,

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:31.157
and you put in so much time,
and you want to be in that game.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:34.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's hard. It's like --
-I feel that way as a fan.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, when my team is out,
as a Steelers fan,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to watch
anything anymore.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I feel like I don't --
I mean, obviously

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:44.537
I don't know, but I feel like
you work harder at it than I do.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.105 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:48.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's questionable.
It's possible. It's possible.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.110
I'll yell at my brother for you.
-Thank you.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I do want to say,
you know,

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm obviously
a huge fan of yours.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:54.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a slightly bigger fan
of your brother TJ

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:57.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he plays on the
Pittsburgh Steelers,
the team I love,

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:00.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
and your other brother Derek
plays for the Chargers.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.922
-That is correct.
-You guys all went to Wisconsin.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We did.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We got some Wisconsin
in the house.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:10.763 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And your mother...

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.832 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.802 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:18.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's a Northwestern guy.
-Yeah, I went to Northwestern.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
Any Cats here? No? All right.
Well, there you go.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're all working down...
-Yeah, exactly.

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.678 size:84% position:42% line:92%
The financial district.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.982 size:88% position:44%
So, your mom -- Somebody
sent this to her, right?

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.251
She got a jersey sent to her --
-Yes, my mom got a jersey.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.720
-Very unique that she has
three children in the NFL.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.089
-She does, and we've played
each other a couple times.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was hurt when I got to play
both of them,

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:39.993 line:92%
but they played each other.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, obviously,
people are always asking,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.062
"What's your mom going to wear?
What's your mom going to wear?"

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
She can't just wear my jersey,
which she wants to.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:48.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this is what
somebody sent her.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:52.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very, very unique jersey
that covers all three logos.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:56.209 size:84% position:42%
And I just realized now
the Watt and the "W"

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:56.910 size:78% position:39% line:92%
is the Wisconsin "W."

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
So that is really --
Somebody put the time in.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:00.213 line:92%
-They did. And each letter --

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:01.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, that's from the Texans
jersey, that's from --

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:04.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, somebody went through
a lot of time

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:05.451 line:92%
for somebody else's family.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very nice.
-I appreciate that.

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:10.390 line:92%
Thank you to whoever sent that.

